{
  "statement": "The GreenAgent emphasizes the importance of sustainability in the RollCall system. GRN-01 ensures energy-efficient algorithms to minimize energy consumption. GRN-02 promotes cloud solutions that prioritize energy-efficient data centers. GRN-03 allows for real-time updates using low-energy protocols. GRN-04 minimizes resource usage in report generation. GRN-05 raises awareness of carbon footprints, while GRN-06 aligns data retention with sustainability. Lastly, GRN-07 optimizes the interface for low-power devices, further enhancing energy efficiency. These requirements collectively foster a responsible approach to technology in education.",
